ipmitool: ipmitool (utility for IPMI control)
ipmitool:
ipmitool: ipmitool is a utility for managing and configuring devices that
ipmitool: support the Intelligent Platform Management Interface (IPMI).
ipmitool: IPMI is an open standard for monitoring, logging, recovery,
ipmitool: inventory, and control of hardware that is implemented independent
ipmitool: of the main CPU, BIOS, and OS.
ipmitool:
ipmitool: This build links against OpenSSL 3 (libssl3 / libcrypto.so.3).
